  "goodToKnow": "Das Ambiente is ambience or atmosphere, especially of a place: ein stilvolles Ambiente, im gediegenen Ambiente. It's a favourite of restaurant reviews and hotel brochures, alongside gemütlich. It comes from Italian ambiente (environment) and is pronounced am-BYEN-te, with the final e spoken. Frankfurt hosts Ambiente, a major consumer goods trade fair. Synonyms: die Atmosphäre, die Stimmung."
